{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01653",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 7.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Hmm, hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.44,
      "end_seconds": 14.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 16.04,
      "end_seconds": 22.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.36,
      "end_seconds": 28.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 28.92,
      "end_seconds": 37.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "Um, you know, it's trouble falling asleep, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.34,
      "end_seconds": 40.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 42.21,
      "end_seconds": 52.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "hmm, it's thyroxine, 75 micrograms, every morning, doctor he is on Asthalin inhaler, when needed, I give it to him"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.31,
      "end_seconds": 59.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 59.74,
      "end_seconds": 67.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "About three months now. It's, It's a herbal sleep tea, at night, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.17,
      "end_seconds": 74.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "I used to take Seretide inhaler, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.81,
      "end_seconds": 77.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.81,
      "end_seconds": 81.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "probably three days. Yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.76,
      "end_seconds": 86.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Right, rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.7,
      "end_seconds": 87.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Severe, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.56,
      "end_seconds": 92.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Mm, okay. So, is there something that settles it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.32,
      "end_seconds": 98.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "so, I get some relief from a warm bath"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.57,
      "end_seconds": 103.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.0,
      "end_seconds": 125.96,
      "duration_seconds": 20.96,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a busy mind at night as well. Ah, uh, as for busy mind at night, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.21,
      "end_seconds": 145.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "any chest pain or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.59,
      "end_seconds": 151.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Erm, um, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.48,
      "end_seconds": 154.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Any snoring or weight change?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.69,
      "end_seconds": 159.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.28,
      "end_seconds": 163.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.08,
      "end_seconds": 167.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Oh, no, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.32,
      "end_seconds": 173.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.83,
      "end_seconds": 176.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.97,
      "end_seconds": 184.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.74,
      "end_seconds": 188.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Yeah, I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.55,
      "end_seconds": 193.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.95,
      "end_seconds": 202.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid, yes. It's the not knowing that gets to me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.34,
      "end_seconds": 205.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.34,
      "end_seconds": 209.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Mm, I've had asthma, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.66,
      "end_seconds": 218.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Alright, asthma, that matches what I have here. What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.81,
      "end_seconds": 222.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "my mother has an underactive thyroid"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.04,
      "end_seconds": 225.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.08,
      "end_seconds": 231.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.75,
      "end_seconds": 234.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.96,
      "end_seconds": 238.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.25,
      "end_seconds": 243.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Okay, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.11,
      "end_seconds": 253.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.91,
      "end_seconds": 257.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.88,
      "end_seconds": 262.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.49,
      "end_seconds": 266.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.64,
      "end_seconds": 281.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "that's it, just a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.16,
      "end_seconds": 299.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 99 percent, heart rate 73, pressure 125 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.39,
      "end_seconds": 305.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.9,
      "end_seconds": 313.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.52,
      "end_seconds": 316.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.57,
      "end_seconds": 329.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Your blood pressure and pulse are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.02,
      "end_seconds": 331.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.72,
      "end_seconds": 347.26,
      "duration_seconds": 12.54,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with poor sleep habits at this stage. I can't rule out mild anxiety yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.9,
      "end_seconds": 350.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.01,
      "end_seconds": 362.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's poor sleep habits, and we'll watch how it goes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.19,
      "end_seconds": 388.84,
      "duration_seconds": 17.65,
      "text": "Keep a fixed bedtime, no screens for an hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.09,
      "end_seconds": 393.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.28,
      "end_seconds": 402.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 404.18,
      "end_seconds": 406.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Actually, thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}